{"id":"vol8-01","section":1,"path":"bank/listening/vol8-01/audio-1.m4a","model":"small","duration":416.77,"segments":[{"start":6.48,"end":12.46,"text":"You will hear a number of different recordings, and you will have to answer questions on what you hear.","words":[["You",6.48,6.96],["will",6.96,7.16],["hear",7.16,7.38],["a",7.38,7.56],["number",7.56,7.9],["of",7.9,8.14],["different",8.14,8.48],["recordings,",8.48,9.08],["and",9.62,9.9],["you",9.9,10.06],["will",10.06,10.18],["have",10.18,10.36],["to",10.36,10.5],["answer",10.5,10.78],["questions",10.78,11.32],["on",11.32,11.68],["what",11.68,11.9],["you",11.9,12.1],["hear.",12.1,12.46]]},{"start":13.12,"end":19.54,"text":"There will be time for you to read the instructions and questions, and you will have a chance to check your work.","words":[["There",13.12,13.64],["will",13.64,13.76],["be",13.76,13.92],["time",13.92,14.24],["for",14.24,14.48],["you",14.48,14.6],["to",14.6,14.7],["read",14.7,15.02],["the",15.02,15.3],["instructions",15.3,15.86],["and",15.86,16.2],["questions,",16.2,16.56],["and",17.14,17.52],["you",17.52,17.68],["will",17.68,17.82],["have",17.82,18.0],["a",18.0,18.12],["chance",18.12,18.4],["to",18.4,18.64],["check",18.64,18.96],["your",18.96,19.18],["work.",19.18,19.54]]},{"start":20.6,"end":23.78,"text":"All the recordings will be played once only.","words":[["All",20.6,21.02],["the",21.02,21.16],["recordings",21.16,21.58],["will",21.58,22.0],["be",22.0,22.16],["played",22.16,22.54],["once",22.54,23.1],["only.",23.1,23.78]]},{"start":25.24,"end":27.94,"text":"The test is in four parts.","words":[["The",25.24,25.56],["test",25.56,26.0],["is",26.0,26.74],["in",26.74,26.88],["four",26.88,27.26],["parts.",27.26,27.94]]},{"start":28.72,"end":32.12,"text":"Write all your answers in the listening question booklet.","words":[["Write",28.72,29.1],["all",29.1,29.36],["your",29.36,29.52],["answers",29.52,29.98],["in",29.98,30.6],["the",30.6,30.74],["listening",30.74,31.08],["question",31.08,31.66],["booklet.",31.66,32.12]]},{"start":32.12,"end":38.96,"text":"At the end of the test, you will be given 10 minutes to transfer your answers to an answer sheet.","words":[["At",32.12,33.38],["the",33.38,33.54],["end",33.54,33.74],["of",33.74,33.86],["the",33.86,33.94],["test,",33.94,34.3],["you",34.78,35.0],["will",35.0,35.14],["be",35.14,35.26],["given",35.26,35.54],["10",35.54,35.98],["minutes",35.98,36.3],["to",36.3,36.68],["transfer",36.68,37.22],["your",37.22,37.44],["answers",37.44,37.82],["to",37.82,38.14],["an",38.14,38.32],["answer",38.32,38.6],["sheet.",38.6,38.96]]},{"start":41.03,"end":44.75,"text":"Now turn to part 1 on page 2 of your question booklet.","words":[["Now",41.03,41.39],["turn",41.39,41.63],["to",41.63,41.83],["part",41.83,42.03],["1",42.03,42.41],["on",42.41,42.87],["page",42.87,43.23],["2",43.23,43.67],["of",43.67,43.85],["your",43.85,43.95],["question",43.95,44.31],["booklet.",44.31,44.75]]},{"start":49.98,"end":50.72,"text":"Part 1","words":[["Part",49.98,50.28],["1",50.28,50.72]]},{"start":50.72,"end":57.96,"text":"You will hear a conversation between a travel agent and a student who is planning a trip abroad.","words":[["You",50.72,52.08],["will",52.08,52.26],["hear",52.26,52.48],["a",52.48,52.72],["conversation",52.72,53.38],["between",53.38,53.82],["a",53.82,54.1],["travel",54.1,54.36],["agent",54.36,54.8],["and",54.8,55.44],["a",55.44,55.62],["student",55.62,56.0],["who",56.0,56.54],["is",56.54,56.66],["planning",56.66,57.0],["a",57.0,57.28],["trip",57.28,57.42],["abroad.",57.42,57.96]]},{"start":59.0,"end":63.6,"text":"First, you have some time to look at questions 1 to 6.","words":[["First,",59.0,59.72],["you",60.14,60.28],["have",60.28,60.46],["some",60.46,60.66],["time",60.66,61.06],["to",61.06,61.48],["look",61.48,61.64],["at",61.64,61.78],["questions",61.78,62.16],["1",62.16,62.72],["to",62.72,63.18],["6.",63.18,63.6]]},{"start":63.6,"end":97.81,"text":"Now listen carefully and answer questions one to six.","words":[["Now",63.6,64.54],